{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"17757","name":"Citadines Lyon Presqu'Ile","description":"Citadines Presqu'île Lyon is located in the heart of Lyon's city center, nestled between the Rhône and Saône rivers in the 2nd arrondissement. This vibrant location places you steps away from the Saint-Jean district, renowned for its Renaissance architecture. Europe's largest pedestrian square, Place Bellecour, and the charming Old Town with its quaint streets, Saint-Jean Cathedral, and Fourvière Basilica are all within a five-minute walk. This aparthotel is surrounded by shops, making it an ideal base for short or long stays. Citadines Presqu'île Lyon offers the comfort of a residential-style apartment with the convenience of a hotel. Facilities include a 24-hour reception, a business area with computer and printer, a breakfast room with buffet option, on-site parking, a laundry room, accessible facilities, and complimentary Wi-Fi. Services include laundry and dry cleaning, business services, 24-hour concierge, and multilingual staff. The fully renovated accommodations include 78 studios and 38 one-bedroom apartments, each featuring modern fittings, a bathroom with bathtub and integrated shower, and a fully equipped kitchen with a refrigerator, dishwasher, and microwave oven.","address":"Rue Thomassin, 2","city":"LYON","countryCode":"FR","postalCode":"69002","lat":45.7613699,"lng":4.8498071,"stars":3,"chain":"ASCOT","giataCode":"10414","phone":"+33478420378","email":"lyonpres@citadines.com","website":"http://www.citadines.com/es/france/lyon/citadines-presquile-lyon/index.html","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/017757/017757a_hb_a_047.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/017757/017757a_hb_a_046.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/017757/017757a_hb_a_045.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata